<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Features</p>
    <h2>What you get.</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>A board.</strong> Every task, every session, one screen.</li>
      <li><strong>Dispatch from the board.</strong> Pick a task, pick an agent, go.</li>
      <li><strong>Blocked means blocked.</strong> Blocked tasks don't dispatch.</li>
      <li><strong>Reviews built in.</strong> Diffs, findings, request changes.</li>
      <li><strong>A merge queue.</strong> Green lands. You don't babysit.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Markdown in your repo.</strong> The backlog lives in
        <code class="mono">.dispatch/</code>.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Two-way Linear sync.</strong> Your tracker stays current.</li>
      <li><strong>Warden.</strong> One chat to steer every session. It asks first.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

